This project builds against, and redistributes, the proprietary BASS audio
library and its add-ons:

    bass/include/bass.h
    bass/include/bass_fx.h
    bass/lib/x64/bass.dll       bass.lib
    bass/lib/x64/bass_fx.dll    bass_fx.lib
    bass/lib/x64/bassflac.dll   bassflac.lib

These files are Copyright (c) Un4seen Developments Ltd. and are governed
solely by the BASS license (https://www.un4seen.com/), NOT by Apache-2.0 or
BSD-3-Clause. BASS is free of charge for non-commercial use; commercial use
requires a license purchased from Un4seen Developments. The BASS files may
not be relicensed, and may only be redistributed as permitted by the BASS
license.

The Windows build also redistributes libwinpthread-1.dll from the mingw-w64
project under its own MIT-style license. See NOTICE.
